# data-models-relationships

## Core Data Models

### Bond Classifications (server/scripts/backfill_bonds.js)
- Structured bond type taxonomy:
  - numeric: Standard monetary bonds
  - refer_to_magistrate: Special case requiring review
  - summons: No monetary value required
  - unsecured: Promise-to-pay bonds
  - no_bond: Detention without bond option
Importance Score: 90

### Time Windows (server/src/lib/buckets.js)
- Standardized tracking periods for inmate processing:
  - 0_24h: Initial booking window
  - 24_48h: Critical processing period
  - 48_72h: Extended hold threshold
  - 3d_7d: Week-level monitoring
  - 7d_30d: Monthly tracking
  - 60d_plus: Long-term cases
Importance Score: 85

### Case Management (server/src/models/Case.js)
Primary entities:
- Defendant
- Bond Amount
- County Assignment
- Case Status
- Check-in Requirements
- Document Attachments

Relationships:
- Case -> County (Many-to-One)
- Case -> Documents (One-to-Many)
- Case -> CheckIns (One-to-Many)
- Case -> BondAmount (One-to-One)
Importance Score: 95

### Enrichment Data Model (server/src/lib/enrichment/providers/)
Entity relationships for defendant verification:
- Primary Identity
- Known Associates
- Address History
- Contact Information
- Risk Indicators
Importance Score: 80

